Package: kolinos-base
Architecture: @KOLIN_DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: KolinOS <dev@kolinos.org>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: kolinos-tools, kolinos-branding, sudo, ca-certificates, bash-completion
Suggests: kolinos-desktop, kolinos-theme
Description: KolinOS base metapackage
 Marks a system as KolinOS and pulls the components that make it one: the
 KolinOS tools, the visual identity and the small set of Debian packages the
 distribution expects to be present. The graphical session (kolinos-desktop)
 is only a Suggests: a headless phone/container install stays lean, and the
 desktop is added explicitly with `apt install kolinos-desktop`.
